# doom/lib/doom/info.rb
#
# **生成物である。手で編集しない。** `tools/gen_info.py` が参照実装の `info.c`
# (id Software, GPL-2.0-or-later) を**コンパイルした `info.o`** から機械的に書き出す。
#
# Only 3 tables are brought in, and not one line of code:
#
#   `SPRNAMES`   138 sprite names (4 characters each). The input of `Doom::Sprites`
#   `STATES`     (sprite, frame, tics, nextstate) of 967 states
#   `MOBJINFO`   (doomednum, spawnstate, radius, height, flags) of 137 kinds
#
# `states[].frame` may have `FF_FULLBRIGHT` (0x8000) ORed in, so the drawing side
# uses `frame & FF_FRAMEMASK` (`p_pspr.h:44-45`).
#
# Embedded as a binary String literal, as the port's conventions say. An integer array literal
# costs compile time. Expanded once, at start-up.

