    # ---- tables added for the tic simulation -----------------------------------
    #
    # The drawing stages needed only the columns that affect drawing. The tic simulation
    # needs `states[].action` (the action functions) and all 23 columns of `mobjinfo[]`.
    # An action is the number of an `ACT_*` constant; `-1` means "none".

    def self.state_action
      column(STATES2_BIN, 7, 3)
    end

